<div style="text-align: right;"><div class="page-rate-widget-box"><span class="rate-points">rating:&nbsp;<span class="number prw54353">+106</span></span><span class="rateup btn btn-default"><a title="I like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, 1)">+</a></span><span class="ratedown btn btn-default"><a title="I don't like it" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.rate(event, -1)">&#8211;</a></span><span class="cancel btn btn-default"><a title="Cancel my vote" href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.modules.PageRateWidgetModule.listeners.cancelVote(event)">x</a></span></div></div>
<p>This is a theme of the Oneiroi Collective GoI, made by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1787851262" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781861); return false;">EstrellaYoshte</a></span> for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5963620); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5963620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1787851262" alt="Luxaiko" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5963620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luxaiko" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5963620); return false;">Luxaiko</a></span>. It is forked from the <a href="/theme:newspaper">Newspaper Theme</a>.</p>
<p>To use the theme, insert the following:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:cosmonaut]]</span></tt></p>
</blockquote>
<p>To use the Twilight version, insert the following instead:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><tt><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[[include&#32;:scp-wiki:theme:cosmonaut&#32;twilight=--]]</span></tt></p>
